1
00:00:02,809 --> 00:00:04,330
I'm Peppa Pig

2
00:00:04,931 --> 00:00:07,106
and this is my little brother, George

3
00:00:07,573 --> 00:00:09,414
This is Mummy Pig

4
00:00:09,895 --> 00:00:11,296
and this is Daddy Pig

5
00:00:13,658 --> 00:00:14,939
Peppa Pig!

6
00:00:16,997 --> 00:00:19,595
"The Boat Pond"

7
00:00:20,742 --> 00:00:22,665
The ducks are swimming in the pond

8
00:00:23,066 --> 00:00:24,450
They're very happy

9
00:00:27,189 --> 00:00:30,883
Peppa, George, Mummy Pig
and Daddy Pig have just arrived

10
00:00:31,004 --> 00:00:32,830
Hello, ducks!

11
00:00:33,765 --> 00:00:35,325
The ducks want bread

12
00:00:35,365 --> 00:00:36,806
Sorry, Mrs Duck

13
00:00:36,846 --> 00:00:39,367
We haven't brought any bread today

14
00:00:39,407 --> 00:00:42,328
But we have brought something much more fun

15
00:00:42,368 --> 00:00:44,576
Peppa has brought her toy boat

16
00:00:46,689 --> 00:00:49,370
And George has brought his toy boat too

17
00:00:51,211 --> 00:00:53,551
Let's wind up your boat first, George

18
00:00:55,680 --> 00:00:58,017
George, your boat needs to be wound up to go

19
00:00:59,006 --> 00:01:00,213
Quick, George!

20
00:01:00,254 --> 00:01:03,458
Put the boat in the pond, or it'll wind down!

21
00:01:10,138 --> 00:01:12,238
George loves his clockwork toy boat

22
00:01:12,279 --> 00:01:13,198
Mummy

23
00:01:13,239 --> 00:01:15,064
Can you wind up my boat?

24
00:01:15,104 --> 00:01:17,465
Peppa, your boat doesn't need winding up

25
00:01:17,705 --> 00:01:19,350
Peppa's boat is a sailing boat

26
00:01:19,390 --> 00:01:21,107
It needs the wind to blow it along

27
00:01:21,147 --> 00:01:23,307
I don't like my boat

28
00:01:23,628 --> 00:01:25,708
It doesn't even move in the water!

29
00:01:25,748 --> 00:01:28,109
That's because there's no wind to blow it today

30
00:01:28,149 --> 00:01:30,230
Maybe it needs a little help

31
00:01:30,430 --> 00:01:31,951
I'll breathe in, and breathe in again...

32
00:01:31,991 --> 00:01:34,272
And blow your boat forward!

33
00:01:39,032 --> 00:01:40,212
Hooray!

34
00:01:40,990 --> 00:01:42,871
It's going really fast!

35
00:01:42,911 --> 00:01:45,197
Peppa loves her toy sailing boat

36
00:01:46,311 --> 00:01:48,552
Peppa's friend has arrived, it's Suzy

37
00:01:48,593 --> 00:01:49,712
Hello, everyone!

38
00:01:49,752 --> 00:01:51,272
Hello, Suzy!

39
00:01:51,432 --> 00:01:53,648
We're playing with toy boats

40
00:01:54,593 --> 00:01:56,673
I've brought my speedboat

41
00:01:56,713 --> 00:01:58,473
Is it clockwork?

42
00:01:58,513 --> 00:02:00,714
No, it takes batteries

43
00:02:02,354 --> 00:02:04,858
Suzy's speedboat is powered by batteries

44
00:02:08,830 --> 00:02:10,476
The speedboat is amazing!

45
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:14,618
Sorry, Mrs Duck!

46
00:02:16,605 --> 00:02:19,048
Danny has arrived with Granddad Dog

47
00:02:19,088 --> 00:02:20,169
Hello, everyone!

48
00:02:20,209 --> 00:02:21,530
Hello, Danny!

49
00:02:21,812 --> 00:02:24,896
My granddad made this paddle boat for me!

50
00:02:28,494 --> 00:02:30,893
It looks amazing!

51
00:02:30,934 --> 00:02:32,259
What powers it?

52
00:02:32,299 --> 00:02:34,061
It's powered by steam

53
00:02:34,262 --> 00:02:37,080
You just push this lever

54
00:02:39,830 --> 00:02:41,912
The paddle boat is amazing!

55
00:02:46,408 --> 00:02:48,568
Rebecca has arrived with her mummy

56
00:02:48,647 --> 00:02:49,848
Hello, everyone!

57
00:02:49,888 --> 00:02:51,527
Hello, Rebecca!

58
00:02:51,567 --> 00:02:53,808
We're playing with toy boats

59
00:03:00,086 --> 00:03:02,045
I wish I had a toy boat too

60
00:03:02,125 --> 00:03:04,165
Rebecca doesn't have a toy boat

61
00:03:04,205 --> 00:03:05,726
I've got an idea

62
00:03:05,766 --> 00:03:08,569
Luckily, I brought my newspaper today

63
00:03:08,649 --> 00:03:10,611
I only need one page

64
00:03:11,052 --> 00:03:12,854
Now, which page can I do without?

65
00:03:12,894 --> 00:03:14,014
The news?

66
00:03:14,055 --> 00:03:14,856
The sports section?

67
00:03:14,896 --> 00:03:16,257
Ah, the fashion page

68
00:03:16,297 --> 00:03:18,018
Not the fashion page!

69
00:03:18,099 --> 00:03:20,624
Alright, I'll use the financial section then

70
00:03:20,664 --> 00:03:22,146
When I was little

71
00:03:22,186 --> 00:03:25,705
I used to make all sorts of things out of newspaper

72
00:03:25,993 --> 00:03:27,805
What is Daddy Pig doing?

73
00:03:28,077 --> 00:03:30,802
Making a paper boat!

74
00:03:30,842 --> 00:03:33,245
Daddy Pig has made a paper boat!

75
00:03:33,916 --> 00:03:35,562
Thank you, Daddy Pig!

76
00:03:37,372 --> 00:03:39,532
George wants a paper boat too

77
00:03:40,653 --> 00:03:43,454
I think I can do without the sports section today

78
00:03:46,329 --> 00:03:47,913
Can I have one, please?

79
00:03:47,954 --> 00:03:49,257
- Me too
- Me too

80
00:03:49,978 --> 00:03:51,058
Of course!

81
00:03:51,098 --> 00:03:53,779
Daddy Pig made a paper boat for each of them

82
00:03:54,461 --> 00:03:55,943
Let's have a race

83
00:03:55,983 --> 00:03:57,707
What a great idea!

84
00:03:57,747 --> 00:03:59,225
We can take a big breath

85
00:03:59,265 --> 00:04:01,394
And blow the paper boats to the other side

86
00:04:01,434 --> 00:04:03,744
Now everyone take a deep breath

87
00:04:05,001 --> 00:04:08,154
Ready, steady, blow!

88
00:04:13,048 --> 00:04:15,077
We have a winner! Oh

89
00:04:15,118 --> 00:04:16,999
Whose boat is the sports section?

90
00:04:17,039 --> 00:04:18,960
That boat is George's

91
00:04:19,001 --> 00:04:20,046
George won!

92
00:04:20,087 --> 00:04:21,474
Hooray!

93
00:04:23,124 --> 00:04:24,644
I love toy boats

94
00:04:24,885 --> 00:04:27,578
But I like paper boats best of all

95
00:04:27,618 --> 00:04:29,126
- Me too
- Me too

96
00:04:30,468 --> 00:04:32,062
Time to go home

97
00:04:32,222 --> 00:04:33,932
Everyone had a lovely time

98
00:04:33,972 --> 00:04:34,972
Bye-bye!

99
00:04:35,293 --> 00:04:36,833
Bye-bye, ducks!

100
00:04:36,873 --> 00:04:37,934
See you later!

101
00:04:37,975 --> 00:04:40,057
The ducks thought the toy boats were lots of fun

102
00:04:40,097 --> 00:04:41,578
But what they like best of all

103
00:04:41,618 --> 00:04:43,846
Is having their pond back to themselves

